@baseUrl = http://localhost:5170

### Validní objednávky → 202
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "productId": "456", "quantity": 5 },
  { "productId": "789", "quantity": 42 }
]

### Stejný produkt znovu → po 20 s má být 456 = 8
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "productId": "456", "quantity": 3 }
]

### Nevalidní productId a quantity → 400 ValidationProblem
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "productId": "abc", "quantity": 0 }
]

### Null položka → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

[null]

### Rozbitý JSON → 400 ProblemDetails
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

[{ "productId": "456", 